{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-1", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "互助会", "storyInfo": "惩戒军德鲁莎对打捞中心的技术工产生了怀疑。另一边，新官上任的克莱门莎意识到岛民与伊比利亚人之间的矛盾不容小觑。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g5_gdsquare_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_harbor_busy", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$factory_low_drone", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs1", "volume": 0.5}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$comedy_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_hammerhit", "volume": 0.2, "delay": 1.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "听到锤子和锯床的声音了吗？各位，你们有多久没在伊比利亚见过造船厂了？", "name": "工头"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "修船、制帆、测风向、画海图……哪怕你毫无经验，也可以从头学起。", "name": "工头"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "岛民们也无需担心，打捞中心和船厂平等地向所有人敞开大门，人人都有机会为两周后港都中心城区的打捞出力！", "name": "工头"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs1", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "港都……黄金时代的都城……它在经典中被批判为罪孽滋生的源头之一。", "name": "阴沉的路人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "岛民同样不可被信任，他们是引来大静谧的元凶的后代，他们是不祥之征……", "name": "阴沉的路人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别再重复教士们的教诲了，萨尔瓦多，赶路的两个月来它可没为我们带来一顿饱饭——但船厂的工作可以。", "name": "洒脱的路人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然如此，为什么还有那么多人跟我们一样站在远处观望？", "name": "萨尔瓦多"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗐，大家都是从偏僻的捕鳞村来的，哪里见过这样的阵仗？", "name": "洒脱的路人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "城区里岛民随处可见，惩戒军却很少盘问他们；人们打招呼的方式不是引用经文，而是直接问对方饭有没有吃饱。", "name": "洒脱的路人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老实说我也不知道打捞港都到底对我们有什么意义，但如果这里的生活更好，我愿意暂时违背经典里的几条教诲。", "name": "洒脱的路人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "圣徒在上，他要是看到了这般混乱的景象会怎么想，到时候我们就需要在审判庭的地牢里忏悔了……", "name": "萨尔瓦多"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不知道圣徒阁下会怎么想，但我知道至少在这里，审判庭不再像原来那样严苛了。", "name": "洒脱的路人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……怎么证明？", "name": "萨尔瓦多"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喏，你看那边——连那个跟黄金时代的雕像勾肩搭背的小姑娘都没被押进地牢里，我们还怕什么？", "name": "洒脱的路人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i04", "xScale": 1.4, "yScale": 1.4, "screenadapt": "coverall", "y": 50.0, "x": 100.0}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.1, "fillto": 0.2, "fadetime": 0.1}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.1, "fillto": 0.2, "fadetime": 0.1}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xTo": 0.0, "duration": 30.0}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咳咳，在万众瞩目的启动仪式上，正是这首由我指挥、由我领唱的船歌，见证了国王的雕像被打捞上岸。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们是否好奇，一个名不见经传的年轻人，怎么会唱伊比利亚百年前的船歌？怎么会穿着完全不合身的海军制服？", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "又怎么会有那么大的胆子，跟审判庭专设的招工处分庭抗礼，堂而皇之地在刚举办过启动仪式的广场上演讲？", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，你们或许有人会说，自从圣徒卡门阁下向全伊比利亚宣布打捞港都的计划之后，审判庭信守的教义不同以往。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可怜的人，我看到你们中的好几个人露出了赞同或迷茫的表情……不过他们的宽容，显然不是我“胆大妄为”的原因。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.2, "fillto": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.2, "fillto": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i04", "xScale": 1.1, "yScale": 1.1, "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喏，看到我身边的这位先生了吗？有谁知道他的名讳？", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这一位，曾经的伊比利亚王室海军上将，埃斯特班·恩里克斯·德·托莱多，与我关系匪浅……", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，你们想必已经猜到了，毕竟我与他的着装和长相如此相像！", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "骨相、脸型、耳羽的位置，甚至发质……还有我身上的王室海军制服，都是他给我留下的证据！", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "两周之后，雷亚-伊比利亚即将归来，你们难道不会好奇，那座曾经属于王室的都城会回到谁的手里？", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小心一点，审判庭的人看过来了……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心，德·托莱多家族赞赏审判庭为伊比利亚付出的一切。我只是想拿回埋葬在港都中心城区中的，属于家族的遗产和宝藏。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleTo": 1.5, "yScaleTo": 1.5, "duration": 0.3}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {"name": "$eb_lensSpeedLines_soft", "layer": 1.0}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "追随我，埃斯特菲尼娅·科隆·德·托莱多，伊比利亚王室海军的继承者。只要一点小小的资助……", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊不对——只要你们拥护我，我也将庇佑你们，无谓出身！", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g5_gdsquare_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "前天盘查的时候她还说自己是乐队的小号手，怎么又成伊比利亚王室海军的继承者了？这么明显的谎话竟然还有人在认真听？", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（打哈欠）不准动手。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道现在审判庭的行动方针很谨慎，但您真的不觉得这个“德·托莱多”很可疑吗？", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#9$1"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果我的观察没错，她的身份一定有问题，甚至可能根本没有获得居住资格。", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#9$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她费尽心机混进来，万一是要对打捞工程不利……德鲁莎教官，我申请拘捕她！", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "驳回。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#8$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我——", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1"}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别太依赖直觉，南多。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道您想让我找证据……", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#9$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "从你开始怀疑的那刻起，哪怕没有证据，也要先去发掘规律。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "规律？", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没错。比如一个月前，打捞中心建成之后，城中发生了十多起前天那样的破坏事件。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它们之间似乎毫无关联，但要是你在岗哨值班的时候，用打捞中心技术工的签到日志画画解闷，就会发现一些意想不到的线索。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "画……画画？", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#5$1"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这不是重点。重点是虽然我们前天遇到的那个技术工与破坏事件无关，但有几个特定的技术工……", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#3$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们进行水下作业的日期与破坏事件发生的日期是完全重合的。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "或许这也能解释为什么近来深海教徒犯案次数逐渐减少，他们不是没有帮手，只是帮手的身份变了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您怀疑这些破坏事件与打捞中心的岛民有关？那……", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#10$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们只是巡逻组的成员。目前我们没有实证也没有搜查权，不要给自己惹麻烦。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（紧盯特菲）", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，什么都没听进去，比驮兽还倔。至少等我走了再动手吧，别给我添麻烦。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#10$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g10_underseacorr", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$wasteland_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "站住，纳乔！怎么又来观测厅？我可检查过了，今天没有你的排班。", "name": "干练的技术工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我说过多少遍了，哪怕你一天不吃不喝全泡在水下连接供能端口，甚至因公殉职，伊比利亚人也不会感激你。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我担任水下作业组的技术负责人不是为了让他们感激我。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“我是不想让他们对岛民的误解再加深”……行了行了，你刚刚是不是又下水了？", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#9$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……嘶。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "手臂上的锈斑已经蔓延到肩上的神经接口，还有——", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "关节处的螺栓怎么丢了？那是鲁菲纳奶奶留给你的过去的老型号，根本找不到替换件！", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "前天不是才帮你拿了防水涂料和生物阻隔剂吗？不对，前天……", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "前天结束任务后你直接去参加岛民互助会了，阿奎拉。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉。下次跟我一起去吧，还能提醒我一下。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那儿的氛围我不太适应。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎么，打破你对伊比利亚的美好向往了？", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉，这里已经足够好了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还不够。能自由地选择工作，能不用每天被惩戒军盘问，这些在伊比利亚人眼中是日常，但对我们而言却是一种殊荣？荒谬！", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1"}, {"id": 175, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且你知道，鲁菲纳奶奶想要的也绝不只是这样。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至少他们安排了一名阿戈尔人来担任打捞中心的新监事。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "无济于事。一个阿戈尔的前执政官不能也不会对伊比利亚的同胞上心。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#10$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不打算参加她的欢迎会吗？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我宁愿去互助会，与我真正的同胞在一起。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "duration": 1.0, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "49_g12_diving", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_deepsearapid", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_swimdeepsea"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2278_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$calm_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "海洋。", "name": "清晰的女声"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "混合层不算太深，这里的海水总是温暖、明亮。微小的浮游生物像空气中的灰尘，恣意游动。", "name": "清晰的女声"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "verticalslider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "51_g12_seabed", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "verticalslider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "海床。", "name": "清晰的女声"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大海的土壤，也是雷亚-伊比利亚沉睡的地方。", "name": "清晰的女声"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它也连接着大陆架上的每一座岛屿，如果你有兴趣，可以漫步海底，走过每一座失落的城镇。", "name": "清晰的女声"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "action": "jump", "posto": "200,0", "times": 1.0, "duration": 1.5, "name": "avg_npc_2278_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼——呼——", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2278_1#1$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放轻松，莫雷诺。这身潜水服相当于让你拥有了鳞兽的鳔，别害怕水流，借它们的力浮起来。", "name": "清晰的女声"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我、我明白了，克莱门莎监事。原本我只是想来参加您的欢迎会，现在却在伊比利亚南部海岸的水下漫步……", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2278_1#1$1"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就当是我独特的欢迎方式吧。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿戈尔与伊比利亚都是依海而生的国度。“岛屿”“波浪”“海床”……我们有许多共通的、关于大海的词语。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这片流动的蓝色环带本身并不可怕。或许有一天，你们不用再借助阿戈尔的全息影像，而是能在真正的、没有界限的海底漫步。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难以置信，我能感受到脸上模糊的阳光，脚下粗糙的贝壳碎屑，还有海流在推动我的后背……", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2278_1#1$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊，不好意思，推你的是负责投影的小帮手。它似乎想提醒你，想要体验的技术工还有很多。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱、抱歉。", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2278_1#1$1"}, {"id": 236, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_switchdata"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "51_g4_aegirstreet_1", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2278_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这是哪里？奇妙的建筑，还有很多穿白袍的阿戈尔人……他们是在空中游动？", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2278_1#1$1"}, {"id": 247, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，环境模拟出了一点差错。小帮手，重新校准数据。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_simulationsystem_off"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g11_clmsoffice", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事，刚刚我看到的就是阿戈尔？", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是阿戈尔的海底城市，弥利亚留姆，也是我曾经执政、生活的地方，我的家。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "离开它之前，我请了两天假，一天用来温习伊比利亚语，检修体内的语言模块，一天用来记住这座城市。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看到的，是根据我的记忆复现的场景。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我甚至都不知道该不该叫它城市，它和我待过的所有地方都太不一样了……阿戈尔和我们，到底还是离得太远……", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事，您可以告诉我，在阿戈尔语中“阿戈尔人”是怎么说的吗？我、我想——", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是想知道，除了“岛民”之外，你是否还拥有另一个称呼，对吗？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 269, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您怎么知道……", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（阿戈尔语）阿戈尔人。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1"}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "请记好，你与我在阿戈尔的语汇中，都以“阿戈尔人”指称。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿……戈……", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（发音生涩的阿戈尔语）“阿戈尔人”……", "name": "紧张的潜水员"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_errormessage"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "检测到无法识别的词语，请使用者再次向说话者确认。", "name": "语言模块"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#3$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "74_i03_2", "xScale": 1.2, "yScale": 1.2, "screenadapt": "coverall", "x": 60.0}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎知道她对面的同胞听不到语言模块的语音提示，也只有她自己能看到浮在空中的警告弹窗。"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们的祖辈离开海洋来到伊比利亚生活，或许从他们的父辈开始，阿戈尔语就已经消失在记忆之中。"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎的亲切帮助他们打开了脑海深处未曾触碰的部分。"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“大海”“游动”“阿戈尔”“阿戈尔人”……"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_errormessage"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.1, "r": 1.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_74_i03_3", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "pfrom": "-160,-30", "pto": "-160,-30", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "aduration": 0.5, "sfrom": 1.0, "sto": 1.1, "sduration": 0.0}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 1.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_errormessage"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.1, "r": 1.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_74_i03_2", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "pfrom": "-430,50", "pto": "-430,50", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "aduration": 0.5, "sfrom": 0.9, "sto": 1.0, "sduration": 0.0}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_74_i03_1", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "pfrom": "-240,-20", "pto": "-240,-20", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 1.0, "aduration": 0.5, "sfrom": 1.0, "sto": 1.1, "sduration": 0.0}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 1.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_74_i03_2", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "sfrom": 1.0, "sto": 0.9, "sduration": 40.0, "pfrom": "-430,50", "pto": "-420,50", "pduration": 40.0}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_74_i03_3", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "sfrom": 1.1, "sto": 1.0, "sduration": 40.0, "pfrom": "-160,-30", "pto": "-165,-35", "pduration": 40.0}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "cgitem", "attributes": {"image": "cgitem_74_i03_1", "style": "cg", "layer": 1.0, "sfrom": 1.1, "sto": 1.0, "sduration": 40.0, "pfrom": "-240,-20", "pto": "-250,-10", "pduration": 40.0}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "ImageTween", "attributes": {"xScaleTo": 1.0, "yScaleTo": 1.0, "yTo": 0.0, "xTo": 0.0, "duration": 40.0}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们生涩的阿戈尔语，令克莱门莎的语言模块频频报错，弹窗几乎遮住了克莱门莎看向同胞们的视线。"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "上岸之前她已经做好了准备。她知道身为打捞计划的提出者，阿戈尔的代表，她无法插手伊比利亚的政策。"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可她还是想接触这群在岸上生活的同胞，想为他们做些什么。"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至少现在，她不想打断这群离家太久太久的同胞，他们有权重新拾回家乡的语言。但显然，并非所有同胞都能领受克莱门莎的好意。"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$darkness01_intro", "key": "$darkness01_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好了，都别再问了！", "name": "警惕的岛民"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿戈尔语离我们太远，学它有什么用？在审判庭盘问我们的时候，为自己加一条可疑的罪状吗？", "name": "警惕的岛民"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先生，不要责怪你的朋友。若你不满意，可以直接指责我。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事，我明白您没有恶意。", "name": "警惕的岛民"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可在伊比利亚，尤其是对岛民而言，亲近海洋是危险的。我们面临的威胁不是靠浪漫的、诗意的词汇就能消除的。", "name": "警惕的岛民"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果我们需要，我们会向同样经历过伊比利亚摧残的同胞求助。至少在互助会里，我不会对自己的身份感到怀疑。", "name": "警惕的岛民"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "互助会……", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（阿戈尔语）“阿戈尔人”。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_correctessage"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {"fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "识别到词语，已校准模块，清除报错提示。", "name": "语言模块"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯？", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果一句标准的阿戈尔语就会让人罪加一等，那我早该待在地牢里了。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g11_clmsoffice", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔？", "name": "警惕的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 343, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿戈尔语和伊比利亚语虽然发音很不一样，但只要找到方法，学会一个词也不是太难。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "无论是“岛民”还是“阿戈尔人”，都是称呼我们的方法。多了解一种，就能多了解“我们”一点，不是吗？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "盖乌斯，下午的水下作业我替你去吧？安赫拉昨天就在催你回家了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 350, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……她身体不好，我回去看看她。", "name": "警惕的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 352, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_glassdoorclose"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，克莱门莎监事。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 359, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们只是最近负担太重，等真的用上阿戈尔制造的装备，水下作业的压力减轻了，他们就不会这样咄咄逼人了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 360, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "减轻他们的负担是我的工作，审判他们可不是。无需多虑。还有，谢谢你替我解围，纳乔。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 362, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您太客气了。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 364, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是水下作业组的对吗？我听说在审判庭最初接管打捞中心的时候，他们欠缺经验，你帮了他们很多。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 366, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有时间的话向我介绍一下你的朋友们吧，我了解阿戈尔的技术，也想了解使用技术的人。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 367, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "十分乐意。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1"}, {"id": 369, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g14_ibchurch_2", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "索莱达，你来了。上周你说迁居到城区之后，和伊比利亚人有不少摩擦，现在情况好转了吗？", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好了不少。我听从了导师和各位同胞的建议，保留了邻居蓄意伤害我的证据。", "name": "欣慰的岛民"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "之后，我找岗哨的审判官和惩戒军倾诉，说邻居的行为已经影响到了我打捞工作的进度。", "name": "欣慰的岛民"}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不知道他们有没有做什么，但那几个邻居确实稍微安分了几天。", "name": "欣慰的岛民"}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是权宜之策。如果你需要帮助，哪怕是宵禁之后，只要点亮我们的信号，就一定会有同胞帮你。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不……我的意思是，我很感谢，但不想再麻烦你们了。", "name": "欣慰的岛民"}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你还是担心我们会把事情闹大，是吗？", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "导师告诉过我，这个城区和我家乡以前的情况不一样，审判庭待我们会更公正，伊比利亚人也不会随意伤害我们。", "name": "欣慰的岛民"}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以我才来这里的。这里确实比其他地方好些，这就够了。", "name": "欣慰的岛民"}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不想伤你的心，但你有没有想过，如果你不会操作阿戈尔的技术设备，如果你只是负责后勤的普通工人，审判庭还会帮你吗？", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我……", "name": "欣慰的岛民"}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "打捞计划公布之后，被召集的岛民大多是工程或航海领域的技术人才，他们重视的不是我们，而是他们自己的打捞计划。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "港都中心城区打捞完成之后，我们又会去哪？是被遣散出境，还是回到令人厌恶的家乡？没有一个伊比利亚人会记得我们的付出。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不会的……", "name": "欣慰的岛民"}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不会？你也不是没听到，那些伊比利亚人骄傲地谈起他们从父辈口中听来的，有关港都的传说时，有半个字提起过岛民吗？", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们甚至不知道，港都曾经的设计和建造，是由岛民主导的。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……要是导师今天在这里，他不会认同你的观点。", "name": "欣慰的岛民"}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有他的认同，我们也应该为自己做些什么，哪怕只是“被记住”。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 412, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 416, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 417, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}